OHOS: resolve the window under the pointer from the window manager layout so
capture keeps the desktop smart-selection behaviour. The OHOS backend uses
physical-pixel stacking order, consumes each owned overlay rectangle only once,
and treats native display id zero as valid. Sub-element requests fall back to
the containing whole window. Deterministic tests cover display zero, owned
rectangle matching and topmost-window hit testing.

